# -dDownsample[Color/Gray/Mono]Images=true
# -d[Color/Gray/Mono]ImageResolution=300
# -d[Color/Gray/Mono]ImageDownsampleThreshold=1.0: Forces Ghostscript
# to compress any image exceeding 300 DPI. Setting this to 1.0 ensures
# no high-resolution images bypass the downsampling filter. 
